 => array('type' => 'integer', 'null' => false, 'default' => null, 'unsigned' => false, 'key' => 'primary'),\n        'user_id' => array('type' => 'integer', 'null' => true, 'default' => null, 'unsigned' => false, 'key' => 'index'),\n        'foreign_key' => array('type' => 'integer', 'null' => true, 'default' => null, 'unsigned' => false, 'key' => 'index'),        \n        'model' => array('type' => 'string', 'null' => true, 'default' => null, 'collate' => 'utf8_general_ci', 'charset' => 'utf8', 'length' => 100),\n        'weight' => array('type' => 'integer', 'null' => true, 'default' => null, 'length' => 4, 'unsigned' => false),               \n        'indexes' => array(\n            'PRIMARY' => array('column' => 'id', 'unique' => 1),\n            'index1' => array('column' => 'user_id', 'unique' => 0),\n            'index2' => array('column' => 'foreign_key', 'unique' => 0)\n        ),\n        'tableParameters' => array('charset' => 'utf8', 'collate' => 'utf8_general_ci', 'engine' => 'InnoDB')\n    );\n}\n```\n\nI tried to execute this command:\n\n```\ncake schema create --plugin UserTags\n```\n\nthis is the output:\n\n```\nWelcome to CakePHP v2.5.5 Console\n---------------------------------------------------------------\nApp : app\nPath: /vagrant/app/app/\n---------------------------------------------------------------\nCake Schema Shell\n---------------------------------------------------------------\nThe chosen schema could not be loaded. Attempted to load:\nFile: /vagrant/app/app/Plugin/UserTags/Config/Schema/schema.php\nName: UserTag\n```\n\n(obviously the file exists)\n\nThen I tried \n\n```\ncake schema create --plugin UserTags UserTags\n```\n\nand it works! so here the problem is that we can not create schemas for plugins with plural names.\n","closed_by":{"login":"markstory","id":24086,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MDg2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24086?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory","html_ur